<h2>Add an Apple Account Card to Wallet</h2><br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/08/add-apple-account-card-wallet-1.jpeg" alt="wallet" width="1920" height="1080" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1058807" /><br/>
